&gt;&gt; I HOPE VERY SOON.
IN MY DISCUSSION WITH OUR

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:10.336
UKRAINIAN FRIENDS, HARBORS WILL
BE READY, TWO OF THEM, IN A FEW

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:19.111
DAYS AND I HOPE THE SHIPS CAN
GO IN, WE WILL BE ABLE, MAXIMUM

00:01:19.111 --> 00:01:23.116
TWO WEEKS, TO START EXPORTING.
BUT THESE THINGS ARE ALWAYS

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:26.619
RELATIVELY COMPLEX, LET'S NOT
