AND THE IDEA THAT IT IS

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:09.062
POSSIBLE TO HAVE SAFE PASSAGES
THAT ALLOW SHIPS TO GO WITHOUT

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:12.065
ANY RISK.
BUT THE AGREEMENT ALSO

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:17.136
ESTABLISHES THAT IN CASE THE
ALLOWANCES THAT WILL NOW BE

00:02:17.136 --> 00:02:21.107
MADE WILL DETECT SOME
IMPROVEMENTS WHICH NEED TO BE

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:23.376
