00:02:23.376 --> 00:02:28.147
ANOTHER COUNTRY TO BE INVOLVED
IN THE QUID THE MINING

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:31.117
OPERATION, WHEREVER NECESSARY.
BUT WE HOPE IT WILL NOT BE

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:34.153
NECESSARY IN THOSE SAFE
PASSAGES IN THE UKRAINIAN

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:38.458
WATERS LEWIS NOT FORGET THAT IN
THESE UKRAINIAN WATERS THE

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.426
