FROM THE RUSSIAN SIDE?

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:54.674
DO YOU TRUST THEM?
&gt;&gt; WELL, NOBODY BELIEVED WHEN I

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:59.512
SAID THREE MONTHS AGO THAT I
HAD MADE THIS PROPOSAL TO

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:03.349
