00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:07.086
STARTING TO WORK ON IT.
EVERYBODY WILL SAY THIS WAS NOT

00:03:07.086 --> 00:03:11.490
POSSIBLE IT HAS HAPPENED.
SO I BELIEVE IT IS IN THE

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:16.029
MUTUAL INTEREST OF THE PARTIES
BECAUSE THESE WILL REPRESENT

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:22.168
NOT ONLY AN IMPORTANCE SOLUTION
FOR UKRAINE THAT HAS ALL OF THE

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:25.438
SILOS OF FOOD, AND THE NEW
HARVEST BEING MADE.

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:30.409
SO IT IS VITAL TO EXPORT
UKRAINIAN GRAINS.

00:03:30.409 --> 00:03:33.079
BUT WE ARE WORKING ALSO, AS IT
IS KNOWN, WITH THE U.S. IN THE

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:36.349
