THERE IS NO SANCTIONS ON

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:42.455
PUTIN'S ABSURD LIES ARE FOR THE
LIES, OR RUSSIAN FERTILIZER.

00:03:42.455 --> 00:03:45.425
SO IT WILL ALSO BE ABLE TO
ACCESS WORLD MARKETS.

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:50.063
AND THESE TWO COMBINED
OPERATIONS WILL BE A HUGE

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:55.468
INJECTION THAT I BELIEVE WILL
BRING PRICES DOWN AND STABILIZE

00:03:55.468 --> 00:04:00.440
