DEVELOPING COUNTRIES IN AN

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:03.142
EXTREMELY DIFFICULT SITUATION
IN VULNERABLE SITUATIONS WHERE

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:05.345
FAMILY IS GROWING, IT WILL
ALLOW THIS TO STOP.

00:04:05.345 --> 00:04:08.914
THAT WAS OUR OBJECTIVE, OUR
MOTIVATION.

00:04:08.914 --> 00:04:12.085
WHAT IS GUIDED US DURING THESE
THREE MONTHS, THERE WERE MANY

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:16.389
DIFFICULT OBSTACLES, BUT I HAVE
TO SAY THAT TODAY I FEEL LIKE

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:18.491
THIS IS PROBABLY THE MOST
IMPORTANT DAY OF MY TENURE

00:04:18.491 --> 00:04:22.495
SECRETARY GENERAL.
